# Sysbuild Kconfig of the zephyr_app (NCS v3.3.0).
#
# MCUboot goes in on the boards with room for two images, which are the
# ones carrying the nRF54LM20A: the board of the project (`gnssbike`) and
# the nRF54LM20 DK it is developed on. The
# (zephyr/dts/vendor/nordic/nrf54lm20_a_b_cpuapp_partition.dtsi) against the
# ~520 KB of this firmware, while the nRF52840 leaves 481 KB per slot
# (nrf52840_partition.dtsi) against 479 KB plus the header, the trailer and
# the SMP transport: no update would ever fit there.
#
# The default below comes before the source line on purpose: in a choice the
# first default that applies wins, and the one of Zephyr (BOOTLOADER_NONE)
# would win otherwise.

choice BOOTLOADER
	default BOOTLOADER_MCUBOOT if BOARD_NRF54LM20DK || BOARD_GNSSBIKE
endchoice

source "share/sysbuild/Kconfig"
